{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/1073651-2e-custom-breaking-points","id":1073651,"title":"[2E] Custom Breaking Points","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Werewolf: The Forsaken"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-04-05T03:34:36-07:00","id":1073651,"title":"[2E] Custom Breaking Points","content":"Hey All, my groups taking their first steps in Character Creation part of the process involves creating at least 2 Custom Breaking points in addition to the common one's listed on page 104. They suggest that they revolve around Auspice, Tribes and Touchstones but as we are all new to Werewolf we are struggling for ideas. Do any of you have any examples for Custom Breaking points for Flesh and Spirit?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7354-monsieurcutts","name":"MonsieurCutts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7354_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"19"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-05T07:19:16-07:00","id":1073709,"title":"","content":"My high purity/honor Rahu Storm Lord had a few. Obviously tailored to him personally. His last pack was dead, which makes some of these relevant. They mostly revolve around his reluctance to join a pack again after being alone for so long, and how seriously he takes his given role of Rahu, and Purity renown.<br /> <br /> Flesh<br /> Suffering a dramatic failure during a Full Moon<br /> Seeing a packmate take aggravated damage (-2)<br /> Refusing a direct challenge from another werewolf <br /> <br /> Spirit<br /> Intentionally giving in to Kuruth (-2)<br /> Delivering the final blow of a Siskur Dah<br /> Sacrificing in the name of the Oath of the Moon<br /> <br /> For my Hunter in Darkness Ithaeur who replaced that guy when he died, I can only remember a couple. Similarly related to her backstory.<br /> <br /> Spirit<br /> Forcibly Binding a spirit to a fetish<br /> Sleeping more than 20 miles out from civilization (the wilds as a touchstone)<br /> <br /> Flesh<br /> Failing to perform a pack rite<br /> Failing to complete a Sacred Hunt (though lapse or other action)<br /> A human or outsider discovering and entering her 'den' (-2)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5279-amravanti","name":"Amravanti","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5279_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"465"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-05T09:30:26-07:00","id":1073764,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Amravanti</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/1073651-2e-custom-breaking-points?p=1073709#post1073709\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">My high purity/honor Rahu Storm Lord had a few. Obviously tailored to him personally. His last pack was dead, which makes some of these relevant. They mostly revolve around his reluctance to join a pack again after being alone for so long, and how seriously he takes his given role of Rahu, and Purity renown.<br /> <br /> Flesh<br /> Suffering a dramatic failure during a Full Moon<br /> Seeing a packmate take aggravated damage (-2)<br /> Refusing a direct challenge from another werewolf<br /> <br /> Spirit<br /> Intentionally giving in to Kuruth (-2)<br /> Delivering the final blow of a Siskur Dah<br /> Sacrificing in the name of the Oath of the Moon<br /> <br /> For my Hunter in Darkness Ithaeur who replaced that guy when he died, I can only remember a couple. Similarly related to her backstory.<br /> <br /> Spirit<br /> Forcibly Binding a spirit to a fetish<br /> Sleeping more than 20 miles out from civilization (the wilds as a touchstone)<br /> <br /> Flesh<br /> Failing to perform a pack rite<br /> Failing to complete a Sacred Hunt (though lapse or other action)<br /> A human or outsider discovering and entering her 'den' (-2)</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Thanks Amravanti this is a great start! I'm going to show these examples to the guys and girls and hopefully they can try and link them to there backstories some more.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7354-monsieurcutts","name":"MonsieurCutts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7354_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"19"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-05T13:05:33-07:00","id":1073847,"title":"","content":"This is something refering in the fluff (Lore of the forsaken) that never had a mechanics backing but i apply to it anyway.<br /> <br /> Learning a gift-&gt; breaking point towards spirit.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2179-lokiravenspeak","name":"LokiRavenSpeak","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1117"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-07T03:54:13-07:00","id":1074580,"title":"","content":"My Storm Lord Ithaeur got the following ones:<br /> <br /> Flesh: Leaving a packmate behind<br /> <br /> Spirit: Intimidating spirits into doing his bidding.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12191-malus","name":"Malus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12191_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1562"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}